stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Attempt1
    Attempt1 --> Valid : reply matches the schema
    Attempt1 --> StartOver : cut off at the output limit
    StartOver --> Attempt2 : original request plus start over, finish well before the limit
    Attempt1 --> Retry : broke a rule, the stream stopped at that point
    Attempt1 --> Retry : other error Instructor reports for the attempt
    Retry --> Attempt2 : original request plus what was written and what was wrong
    Attempt2 --> Valid
    Attempt2 --> Failed : any failure
    Failed --> [*] : explained in the chat (failure_explanations.py)
    Valid --> [*]
